<div class="plans-grid">
  <article class="plan-card">
    <div class="plan-card__top">
      <h3>Free</h3>
      <span class="worker-status-badge">Available now</span>
    </div>
    <p class="plan-card__lead">Everything you need for a family or a small group.</p>
    <ul class="plan-card__list" role="list">
      <li>Up to 4 people in each Space you own, yourself included</li>
      <li>1 connected computer (Syntila Workspace)</li>
      <li>1 AI request running at a time; messages between people are not limited</li>
      <li>1 GB of file storage, up to 25 MB per file</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="button button--primary" href="https://syntila.app" data-site-event="cta.open_app">Open Syntila <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </article>

  <article class="plan-card">
    <div class="plan-card__top">
      <h3>Syntila Plus</h3>
      <span class="worker-status-badge worker-status-badge--testing">Coming later</span>
    </div>
    <p class="plan-card__lead">For larger groups and people who host several computers.</p>
    <ul class="plan-card__list" role="list">
      <li>Larger Spaces</li>
      <li>More connected computers</li>
      <li>Several AI requests at the same time</li>
      <li>25 GB of file storage, up to 100 MB per file</li>
      <li>Share a Workspace directly with another person</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="plan-card__note">Price and start date are not announced yet.</p>
  </article>
</div>
<p class="plans-note">
  Your AI provider's own subscription or usage charges are separate. Before other people use a Worker you connected, check that your provider plan allows it. <a href="/faq/#sharing-subscriptions">What to check</a>
</p>
